            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "heading_spacing": 24,
            "subtext": "<h1>✅ COMPLETE SHOWROOM RESET</h1><h1>£500+ VALUE</h1><p>✓ Full exterior detail</p><p>✓ Full interior detail</p><p>✓ Engine bay detail</p><p>✓ Full vehicle decontamination</p><p>✓ Wheels, arches and calipers detailed</p><p>✓ Glass done inside and out</p><p>✓ Tyres dressed</p><p>✓ Every surface detailed and finished with premium dressings</p><h1>✅ FULL VEHICLE CERAMIC PROTECTION</h1><h1>£1,000+ VALUE</h1><p>✓ Paintwork ceramic coated</p><p>✓ Wheels ceramic coated</p><p>✓ Brake calipers ceramic coated</p><p>✓ Glass ceramic coated</p><p>✓  Soft top ceramic coated</p><p>✓ Leather ceramic coated</p><p>✓ Alcantara ceramic coated</p><p>✓ Fabric ceramic coated</p><p>✓ Carpets ceramic coated</p><p>✓ Interior surfaces dressed and protected</p><h1>✅ <strong>LONG-TERM VEHICLE PRESERVATION</strong></h1><p>✓ Extreme gloss</p><p>✓ Interior protection</p><p>✓ Exterior protection</p><p>✓ Sun damage protection</p><p>✓ Hydrophobic protection</p><p>✓ Swirl mark protection</p><p>✓ Water spot protection</p><p>✓ Rust & paint bubbling protection</p><p>✓ Every surface dressed and protected</p><p>✓ Kills 99.99% of germs and mould</p><p>✓ Easier maintenance</p><p>✓ Lasts up to 5 years</p><h1>TOTAL VALUE - £2000+</h1><h1>TODAY</h1><p><strong>Exotic, Classic & Sports Cars — £999</strong></p><p><strong>SUVs & Luxury 4x4s — £1199</strong></p>",
