        "ai_gen_block_7df23dd_3Bd6eE": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_7df23dd",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ceramic Coating Isn't Just About Making Your Car Shine",
            "heading_font": "oswald_n7",
            "heading_size": 56,
            "heading_line_height": 1.2,
            "heading_letter_spacing": 0.5,
            "heading_text_transform": "uppercase",
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "heading_spacing": 20,
            "subtext": "<p>It's About Preserving It.</p><p><strong>The problem is that every year:</strong></p><ul><li>Washing creates swirl marks</li><li>Water spots become permanent</li><li>The sun makes your paint look dull</li><li>Constant rain & moisture causes deterioration</li><li>Neglected paintwork becomes increasingly expensive or impossible to correct<br/></li></ul><p><strong>The 360° Showroom Reset And Protection Package</strong> is designed to prevent that.</p><p><strong>The result:</strong> Your car will leave looking <strong>like the day you bought it - </strong>deep, mirror-like gloss on the outside and a fresh, protected interior on the inside — with the long-term defense against swirl marks, dirt, sun damage, water spots, paint bubbling, rust and stains.</p>",
