            "heading_size": 56,
            "heading_line_height": 1.2,
            "heading_letter_spacing": 0.5,
            "heading_text_transform": "uppercase",
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "heading_spacing": 24,
            "subtext": "<p>This is not a discount.</p><p>It's an invitation to show you what we're capable of.</p><p><strong>The 360° Showroom Reset & Protection Package</strong> has been created to demonstrate the highest standard of vehicle preservation in the industry.</p><p>We believe a luxury vehicle should spend its lifetime in showroom condition - not just the day it was collected.</p><p>For the last 12 years, our team built its reputation detailing vehicles under Fratelli-X, working on some of the finest cars in the world.</p><p>We've recently set up FX Detailing as an independent luxury car detailing company based within Fratelli-X.</p><p>The standards remain exactly the same.</p><p>No shortcuts.</p><p>No rushed timer.</p><p>No arbitrary end point.</p><p>We continue until <strong>nothing else can be done</strong> to a vehicle.</p><p>Because for the cars we work on, perfection isn't optional - <strong>it's the only acceptable outcome.</strong></p>",
